 "<p class=\"muted small\">What do you want more of? Pick up to three, and your daily card leans toward them.</p>\n      <div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"What you want more of\">{0}</div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">Your own small things</div><p class=\"muted small\">Up to three. Some days the card you turn over is one of yours, and doing it finds a Forgeling like any other day.</p>\n      {1}\n      {2}\n      {3}": "<p class=\"muted small\">もっと増やしたいことは何ですか？3つまで選ぶと、毎日のカードがそちらに寄っていきます。</p>\n      <div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"もっと増やしたいこと\">{0}</div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">あなたの小さなこと</div><p class=\"muted small\">3つまで。めくったカードがあなたのものになる日もあります。やり遂げれば、いつもの日と同じようにフォージリングに出会えます。</p>\n      {1}\n      {2}\n      {3}",
 "Sound@renderSettings": "サウンド",
