 "Compatibility@renderSettings": "互換モード",
 "<p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Soft music needs the standard method.</p>": "<p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">やさしい音楽は標準モードでのみ流れます。</p>",
 "<p class=\"muted small\">Soft pixel-style sounds, all made on your device.</p>\n      <div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setSound\" aria-pressed=\"{0}\">Sound {1}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setSfx\" aria-pressed=\"{2}\">Sound effects {3}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setAmb\" aria-pressed=\"{4}\">Fire crackle {5}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setNature\" aria-pressed=\"{6}\">Nature sounds {7}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setMusic\" aria-pressed=\"{8}\">Soft music {9}</button></div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">Volume</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Volume\">{10}</div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">Sound method</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Sound method\">{11}</div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" id=\"auStatus\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{12}</p>\n      <button class=\"pill\" id=\"soundCheck\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Run a sound check</button>\n      {13}": "<p class=\"muted small\">やわらかなドット風の音。すべて端末の中で作られます。</p>\n      <div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setSound\" aria-pressed=\"{0}\">サウンド {1}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setSfx\" aria-pressed=\"{2}\">効果音 {3}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setAmb\" aria-pressed=\"{4}\">たき火の音 {5}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setNature\" aria-pressed=\"{6}\">自然の音 {7}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setMusic\" aria-pressed=\"{8}\">やさしい音楽 {9}</button></div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">音量</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"音量\">{10}</div>\n      <div class=\"lbl2\">再生方法</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"再生方法\">{11}</div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" id=\"auStatus\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{12}</p>\n      <button class=\"pill\" id=\"soundCheck\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">サウンドを確認する</button>\n      {13}",
 "Look and feel": "見た目と動き",
 "less motion": "動きを少なく",
 "Auto@renderSettings": "自動",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">Writing</div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:2px 0 6px\">Your words are handwritten in the journal. Plain print is easier to read for some people.</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Writing\"><button class=\"chip\" data-sethand=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"{0}\">Handwriting</button><button class=\"chip\" data-sethand=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"{1}\">Plain print</button></div>": "<div class=\"lbl2\">文字</div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:2px 0 6px\">日記の言葉は手書き風で書かれます。シンプルな文字のほうが読みやすい方もいます。</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"文字\"><button class=\"chip\" data-sethand=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"{0}\">手書き風</button><button class=\"chip\" data-sethand=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"{1}\">シンプル</button></div>",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">Forgeling mood</div><p class=\"muted small\">Which Forgelings you find from now on. The ones you already have stay.</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Forgeling mood\">{0}</div><div class=\"lbl2\">Comfort</div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setReduce\" aria-pressed=\"{1}\">Reduce motion {2}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setLore\" aria-pressed=\"{3}\">Whispers and tales {4}</button></div><div class=\"lbl2\">Appearance</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Appearance\">{5}</div><div class=\"lbl2\">The page</div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:2px 0 6px\">Your journal is paper by day and lamplit at dusk and night. Dark keeps it lamplit. Plain keeps a quiet, flat look instead of the journal.</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The page\">{6}</div>{7}": "<div class=\"lbl2\">フォージリングの雰囲気</div><p class=\"muted small\">これから出会うフォージリングの種類です。今いる子たちはそのままです。</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"フォージリングの雰囲気\">{0}</div><div class=\"lbl2\">快適さ</div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setReduce\" aria-pressed=\"{1}\">動きを減らす {2}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"setLore\" aria-pressed=\"{3}\">ささやきと物語 {4}</button></div><div class=\"lbl2\">外観</div><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"外観\">{5}</div><div class=\"lbl2\">ページ</div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:2px 0 6px\">日記は昼は紙、夕方と夜はランプの灯りになります。ダークはいつもランプの灯り。シンプルは日記ではなく、静かで平らな見た目になります。</p><div class=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"ページ\">{6}</div>{7}",
 "Your collection": "コレクション",
 " Forgeling@renderSettings": "体のフォージリング",
 " · save or restore a copy": " · コピーの保存と復元",
 "<div class=\"numgrid\"><div class=\"num\"><b>{0}</b><span>days showed up</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{1}</b><span>Forgelings</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{2}</b><span>rare or better</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{3}</b><span>packs opened</span></div></div><div class=\"lbl2\">Backup</div><p class=\"muted small\">Your collection lives on this device. Save a copy so you can move it or restore it.</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnExport\">Save a copy</button><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnRestore\">Restore a copy</button></div>{4}": "<div class=\"numgrid\"><div class=\"num\"><b>{0}</b><span>来た日数</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{1}</b><span>フォージリング</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{2}</b><span>レア以上</span></div><div class=\"num\"><b>{3}</b><span>開けたパック</span></div></div><div class=\"lbl2\">バックアップ</div><p class=\"muted small\">コレクションはこの端末の中にあります。コピーを保存しておけば、移したり元に戻したりできます。</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnExport\">コピーを保存</button><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnRestore\">コピーから復元</button></div>{4}",
 "About@renderSettings": "このアプリについて",
 "Fair odds, privacy and terms": "公正な確率、プライバシー、利用規約",
 ", with a copy in your own iCloud if you keep that on. Forgelings can never see it": "（iCloudをオンにしていれば、あなた自身のiCloudにもコピーが置かれます。Forgelingsがそれを見ることはできません）",
 ", and in Android’s own backup if that is on": "（Androidのバックアップがオンなら、そこにも保存されます）",
 "Adult (18 and up)": "大人（18歳以上）",
 "Not set": "未設定",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">Fair odds</div><p class=\"muted small\">Packs are earned, never sold. Check the odds yourself.</p><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnOdds\">See the odds</button><div class=\"lbl2\">Privacy</div><p class=\"muted small\">Everything you do in Forgelings stays on this device{0}. It has no accounts and sends nothing anywhere: no server, no tracking, no ads. Your birth date is not stored, only that you are an adult.</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnPrivacy\">How Forgelings handles your data</button><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnTerms\">Terms of use</button></div><p class=\"small\">Age setting: <b>{1}</b></p>": "<div class=\"lbl2\">公正な確率</div><p class=\"muted small\">パックは手に入れるもので、売り物ではありません。確率はご自身で確かめられます。</p><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnOdds\">確率を見る</button><div class=\"lbl2\">プライバシー</div><p class=\"muted small\">Forgelingsでのことは、すべてこの端末の中に残ります{0}。アカウントはなく、どこにも何も送りません。サーバーも、追跡も、広告もありません。生年月日は保存せず、大人であることだけを記録します。</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnPrivacy\">データの扱いについて</button><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnTerms\">利用規約</button></div><p class=\"small\">年齢設定：<b>{1}</b></p>",
 "Feedback@renderSettings": "フィードバック",
 "A few quick questions, and your report": "いくつかの質問と、あなたのレポート",
 "Send my report": "レポートを送る",
 "Copy my report": "レポートをコピー",
 "<p class=\"muted small\">Answer as many as you like, whenever you like.</p>{0}<div class=\"lbl2\">My report</div><p class=\"muted small\">A short summary, plus anything you wrote above, that you can send to whoever is gathering feedback.</p><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnReport\">{1}</button>": "<p class=\"muted small\">答えたいものだけ、好きなときに答えてください。</p>{0}<div class=\"lbl2\">レポート</div><p class=\"muted small\">短いまとめと、上に書いた内容です。フィードバックを集めている人に送れます。</p><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnReport\">{1}</button>",
 "Erase everything here and in iCloud": "この端末とiCloudのすべてを消去",
 "Erase everything on this device": "この端末のすべてを消去",
 "<div class=\"jplate\"><span class=\"k\">This journal was started</span><b>{0}</b><span>{1} {2} kept · {3} {4}</span></div>\n    {5}\n    {6}\n    {7}\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    {10}\n    {11}\n    {12}\n    <div class=\"erase\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnErase\">{13}</button></div>\n    {14}\n    <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0\">{15}</p>": "<div class=\"jplate\"><span class=\"k\">この日記をはじめた日</span><b>{0}</b><span>{1}{2}の記録 · {3}{4}</span></div>\n    {5}\n    {6}\n    {7}\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    {10}\n    {11}\n    {12}\n    <div class=\"erase\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"btnErase\">{13}</button></div>\n    {14}\n    <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0\">{15}</p>",
